<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .code { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: #3D47F5; text-align: center; padding: 24px; background: #f5f6ff; border-radius: 12px; margin: 24px 0; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .warning { background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #92400e; }
    .footer { color: #999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <p>Hi <%= @user_name %>—</p>
  <p>Here is your Yagye sign-in code. It expires in <strong><%= @expires %> minutes</strong>.</p>

  <div class="code"><%= @code[0..2] %>&nbsp;<%= @code[3..5] %></div>

  <div class="warning">
    If you did not request this code, someone may be trying to access your account.
    You can safely ignore this email — your account remains secure.
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #555;">
    Once you have signed in, we recommend setting up an authenticator app for faster, more secure sign-ins.
  </p>

  <div class="footer">
    Do not share this code with anyone. Yagye staff will never ask for it.<br>
    This message was sent by Yagye Payment Services.
  </div>
</body>
</html>
